<p>Stony spikes erupt from the ground in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 5, 5</acronym> cone.</p><p>Creatures caught in the area will be cut for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">153, 205, 246, 281, 312</acronym> Physical damage dealt over 6 turns.</p><p>The damage increases with your Spellpower, and the chance to apply the detrimental effect(s) improves with Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.</p>